+ * GHSA-v836-6xw4-9cx3 — bufferAllocLimit bypass via ArrayBuffer / SharedArrayBuffer /
+ * TypedArray / WebAssembly.Memory constructors (host memory-exhaustion DoS).
+ *
+ * Regression test authored for the backport onto vm2 3.10.5 (the upstream
+ * test/ghsa/GHSA-v836-6xw4-9cx3/repro.js is not shipped in this target tree).
+ * Grounded on the upstream repro: a finite `bufferAllocLimit` must cap the
+ * backing-store allocation constructors that share the synchronous, timeout-immune
+ * V8 allocation path, while leaving small allocations and the default (Infinity)
+ * behaviour untouched.
